// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3763662175" "I've seen what you brought back, and it's jaw-dropping. Oh, we have Lockhart dead to rights for sure. I'll get all of this to the right people. Check back with me soon, though. I'll keep you updated on the case."
// RandomFameString :
"P3075790830" "Looks like the case against Tyrone Lockhart is getting pretty serious!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2107673159" "The verdict on Tyrone Lockhart came down, {HeroName}. Conspiracy, aiding a known supervillain, even treason. They threw the book at him! He's not going down quietly, though. He bolted, and is currently hiding out with a bunch of Nemesis Army troops he had hidden in a Lockhart office, probably waiting for some last-minute extraction by Nemesis. {HeroName}, I don't want Tyrone Lockhart to escape. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You're the one that found the key evidence, so I think it's only right that you get to capture Tyrone Lockhart.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3561769281" "Capture Tyrone Lockhart"
// SendOffString :
"P255962538" "I've marked the location for you. Lockhart and a couple members of his board of directors are holed up in there. Now that the game's up, they've shown that they're all Nemesis Army members, so they're going to put up a fight. But I know you can handle it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2713373246" "Capture Tyrone Lockhart & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3751907351" "This is something that's been waiting a long time, {HeroName}. I know you can bring in Tyrone Lockhart and his men."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1699579172" "The police have barricaded every exit from the Lockhart offices in this building and evacuated the surrounding floors. You're clear to go in and mop up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2149114432" "None shall bypass me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2456394958" "Mr. Lockhart is not taking appointments, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3633832632" "Tyrone Lockhart"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P597995977" "Lord Nemesis has promised us a rescue!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2592611401" "This is all your fault, {HeroName}! You'll never take me alive!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2678945400" "You have captured Tyrone Lockhart and his board of directors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2154822099" "I saw the whole thing, {HeroName}. Fantastic stuff, and it's just the start. I'm already on the phone trying to subpoena as much of Lockhart's records as I can before the NSA declares it all top secret. I think there's going to be a lot of very interesting information in there about Nemesis' plans and his forces. <br><br>Check back with me soon. I think I'm going to need your help again before too long."
// RandomFameString :
"P1398153966" "Wow, {HeroName}, what was it like fighting that traitor Tyrone Lockhart?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2050516535" "I've started going through the files I've been able to get from Lockhart Aerotech. A lot of interesting things are already starting to turn up. It seems that Lockhart often used the Sky Raiders to do jobs for Nemesis, but the Sky Raiders didn't know who was really pulling the strings for the most part. Seems Nemesis was trying to either absorb them or set them up as fall guys. <br><br>Anyway, I found that the Sky Raiders recently performed an abduction for Lockhart on Nemesis' orders. The weird thing is, I can't figure out why they must have grabbed the guy, and that got my interest. Nemesis never does anything without a reason, and it's usually something nasty. The victim's name was Bentley Berkeley. He's supposed to be immortal, and though I don't know much about him, I've heard that he's helped out against the Council a couple of times. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could find Bentley Berkeley, he could tell us why Nemesis might be interested in him.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1499309701" "Find Bentley Berkeley"
// SendOffString :
"P1105683618" "This should be pretty easy for you. The Sky Raiders are the only ones who know where to find Berkeley. Put some pressure on them and they should start talking. Once we know where they're keeping Bentley Berkeley, the next step will be breaking him out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2815949731" "Interrogate Sky Raiders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4091114107" "This should be pretty easy for you. The Sky Raiders are the only ones who know where to find Berkeley. Put some pressure on them and they should start talking. Once we know where they're keeping Bentley Berkeley, the next step will be breaking him out. <br><br>You can probably find some Sky Raiders around Terra Volta. Won't they be surprised to see you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1710085869" "One of the defeated Sky Raiders told you what you wanted to know."
// RandomFameString :
"P3028846102" "Not that I have a lot of sympathy for them, {HeroName}, but what did the Sky Raiders do to get your attention?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3963472492" "Time may be running out for Bentley Berkeley, {HeroName}. You may need to hurry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3702468777" "This old warehouse's interior has been recently refurnished and stocked with military supplies for the Nemesis Army."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1609816487" "Desk"
// InteractBeginString :
"P174021746" "You begin searching the desk."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P554170719" "You finish searching the desk."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3374600750" "You found information on Bentley Berkeley's location."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P170942947" "Nemesis had Berkeley kidnapped for medical experimentation? That's pretty sick, but I wouldn't put it past Nemesis at all. It explains what they want with him, but it still doesn't explain why they'd want to conduct medical experiments in the first place. Biology really isn't Nemesis' strongest area. With the information you found there and what we have in Lockhart's files I should be able to figure out where they might have taken Berkeley. Check with me soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2782380141" "I was able to find where Nemesis' soldiers took Bentley Berkeley after the Sky Raiders handed him over to them. I think he's still at the location, too. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>All that you'll need to do is rescue Bentley Berkeley from Nemesis' forces.</A> Not easy, I know. It gets more complicated, too. I still don't know the full story, but it seems that Berkeley was key to foiling some major scheme of the Center's, and now the Council wants Berkeley's head. Berkeley's become a bone of contention between the Council and the Nemesis Army, so there's a good chance that the Council may decide to take a shot to grab him. You'll need to be ready either way. "
// AcceptString :
"P1033703918" "Rescue Bentley Berkeley from Nemesis' forces"
// SendOffString :
"P2560762764" "Once you find Berkeley, be sure to ask him if he knows why Nemesis wanted him in the first place. We know it had something to do with medical experiments, but we still don't know why Nemesis is working in that field, or if it ties together with any of the other work Nemesis was doing through Lockhart Aerotech."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3204758426" "Rescue Bentley Berkeley"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2889618867" "Berkeley may have some interesting things to say, {HeroName}. Maybe he can explain what Nemesis wanted with him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2035031201" "This lab was well hidden underneath the old warehouse. If you hadn't learned of its location, you never would have found it."

