// ModelDisplayName :
"P622539534" "Captured Lieutenant"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1426249826" "This is all the fault of one person: {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bodies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3734178117" "Body"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1984236427" "You begin searching the body for ID."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1313222230" "You found an ID on the body."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4155663808" "This member of the Paragon City Police gave his life to protect the city's citizens. He was likely killed by a warwolf."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bodies2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2475295677" "This innocent citizen of Paragon city was shot in the back, probably by a Nemesis Army chain gun."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3091211627" "You've gotten people to safety and done what you can to stop the battle between the Nemesis Army and the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2145981821" "From what that Nemesis soldier told you and from what I've learned on my own, it looks like the Center has ordered the Council to strike directly at the Nemesis Army. We've done a lot to hurt Nemesis recently, so I guess the Center thinks that Nemesis has got to be pretty weak right now. This could get really bad, {HeroName}. Whoever wins will likely be able to absorb a lot of the other group's bases, material, and manpower. That could be catastrophic. <br><br>I've spent my whole career, hell, my whole life trying to bring Nemesis down. Now he's at the weakest he's been since escaping General Sherman in the Civil War, but I didn't think something like this would happen. <br><br>Don't listen to me right now, {HeroName}. You've done great. Just check back with me soon. I'm going to try and figure out how serious this conflict is."
// RandomFameString :
"P1622923188" "I'm glad you stopped that battle between Nemesis and the Council. {HeroName}. I haven't seen a fight like that since the Rikti War."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2506298805" "The Nemesis Army and the Council are going for each other's throats in an all-out war of conquest, and Nemesis seems to be losing. I can't believe it, but it looks like Nemesis's forces have been hurt worse than I ever suspected by all the defeats you've handed him. At this rate, the Council will be able to absorb Nemesis's entire organization within a month. Then the Center would have Nemesis as a replacement for Vandal! They'd be unstoppable! <br><br>So, God help me, I need to ask you to help me, and I can't believe I'm saying this, but help me help Nemesis by attacking the Council. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I've discovered a key ammo depot for the Council; I'd like you to hit the supply depot and scour it for intelligence.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1701084657" "Hit the Council supply depot"
// SendOffString :
"P4251799729" "Okay, you can either take out the weapons stockpiles or the personnel on the base. Either should work. You also need to find some intelligence that could help us target the next strike more precisely. <br><br>I know that this may not seem right, {HeroName}, but remember that we're still hurting the Council, not supporting Nemesis. Taking Nemesis down for good is still my top priority, but I don't want to see another megalomaniac like the Center benefit from that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound6_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3629522921" "Hit depot, find intelligence"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2103419577" "You can either take out the weapons stockpiles or the personnel on the base. Either should work. You also need to find some intelligence that could help us target the next strike more precisely. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P370793088" "This Council supply base is extremely busy, moving weapons and equipment to other bases to supply them in their battle against the Nemesis Army."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P510459113" "Nemesis will surely fall before the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1966593706" "Yes. We will crush him beneath our boot."

