// Dialog :
"P1044857075" "You found some orders about an upcoming inspection."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1262090467" "You destroyed the ammo supply facility, and found vital information about Archon Cassidy, the head of the Council's war effort against Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound6_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P658543799" "Defeat Cassidy & his aides"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3944149112" "I'm in total agreement with you. Taking out Archon Cassidy could be just enough to weaken the Council's efforts without tipping the balance. Catch him and his staff and it could change a lot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2324107938" "We don't appreciate your interference in our war, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1316340767" "Deep beneath the old warehouse above, you've found a hidden access to the Council base where Field Marshal Bulech should be, awaiting the review of his troops."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2362148303" "Archon Cassidy"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P980152097" "How can we be under attack? My schedule and location have been kept secret!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2953371853" "You have been a thorn in the Council's plans for too long, {HeroName}. Now you shall be plucked out and crushed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2394349719" "You captured Archon Cassidy, hopefully crippling the Council's war effort against Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2048099175" "With Cassidy under wraps, the Council's going to need to reorganize. I was hoping that it will be enough of a pause to even things out between the Nemesis Army and the Council, and some of the reports I'm seeing already are pointing to that. Still feels wrong, though. Like it was too easy. <br><br>Like it was something Nemesis should have been able to do himself. <br><br>Like it was something to distract us. <br><br>Oh no. Oh, no, No, NO! I'm afraid of something, {HeroName}. Something bad. Maybe I'm just paranoid. I hope I'm just paranoid. But maybe I haven't been paranoid enough. I've got to check on this. Talk to me soon."
// RandomFameString :
"P4203751401" "I heard you were fighting the Council, {HeroName}. Weren't you concentrating on Nemesis, though?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3305418861" "This is my fault, {HeroName}. We've been used. Nemesis was only playing at being weak. He played on the Council's sense of superiority, by allowing them to win the early rounds. He played on our sense of accomplishment and made us think we'd hurt his forces badly, then let us distract ourselves by attacking his enemy for him. Now he's on the counter-attack. <br><br>Fortunately, we still have some information he doesn't know about, thanks to you. Nemesis' counter-attacks fit a pattern hinted at in the research funding he's done to reverse engineering Vandal's robot designs and computer programming. I think Nemesis is planning to take over the Council's computer and robotic infrastructure and achieve a 'coup de tech.' The result could be as bad as if the Center had won. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The first step to stopping him will be to prevent Nemesis from usurping the Council's computer network and taking over their robots.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3497206951" "Prevent Nemesis from usurping the Council's network"
// SendOffString :
"P2660735162" "The Nemesis Army has recently captured a Council computer center. Your job is to either capture it back, or to take the computers there offline before Nemesis can use them to take over the whole network. After that, you'll need to stop him from taking direct control of the Council's robots. <br><br>I feel like a fool, {HeroName}. I've spent my entire career fighting Nemesis, and now he uses me as a tool to send you against his enemies. But this isn't over. Nemesis hasn't won yet."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Compound7_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P25355245" "Take Council computer center"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1134097803" "You're job is to either capture the computer center, or to take the computers there offline before Nemesis can use them to take over the whole network. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4192359060" "This base is a hub of the Council's computer network. If Nemesis can take that over, it could give him control of their bases."

