// ActiveTaskString :
"P3892051239" "Take Council robot center"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2419578915" "You can either take out all the Nemesis troops and overridden robots in the  whole robot center, or concentrate your efforts on taking out the devices Nemesis plans to use to take over the Council's robots. Either way should achieve the same results."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P312532020" "A secret passage concealed in the sewer system leads to this base. It looks like the battle here was long over. It's good you're here to start a new one."

