// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3758028084" "You are trespassing on Nemesis Army property."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - OTTOMcRC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P451422157" "Override devices"
// Description :
"P1395102720" "override devices to destroy"
// SingularDescription :
"P2637298472" "Destroy the last robot override devices!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3387922464" "You begin destroying the robot override devices."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2399011445" "You have destroyed the robot override devices."
// InteractActionString :
"P3365161279" "Destroying..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1571701375" "You destroyed the override devices and prevented Nemesis from taking control of the Council's robots."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3415604202" "You did it, {HeroName}. Nemesis won't be able to make an easy take-over of the Council now. I wish I had some good news to tell you now that you're back, but I'll give you the bad:<br> We've been duped. Again!<br><br>While we were distracted keeping Nemesis from taking over the Council, Nemesis struck at his real target. He managed to kidnap Nosferatu, the mad biomechanical genius responsible for the  Council's Cor Leonis and vampyri. I don't know what he wants with him, but this can't be good. <br><br>I'm tired of being Nemesis' pawn, {HeroName}. I won't be used like this. I won't let him use us like this. I've spent my whole career fighting Nemesis, but I've never wanted to see him go down as much as I do right now. Talk to me soon. This isn't over."
// RandomFameString :
"P1960740726" "I hear you've had a lot of successes against Nemesis, {HeroName}. That's gotta feel good!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P523810998" "At the conclusion of his battle against the Council, Nemesis managed to capture Nosferatu, the mad doctor responsible for the Council's Cor Leonis and vampyri. He used us, he used the Council, and now he plans to use Nosferatu. What Nemesis wants him for is still a mystery, but I think it may have something to do with Nemesis' early kidnapping of the immortal Bentley Berkeley and all of the weapons testing and data gathering the Nemesis Army been doing. <br><br>However, one thing I know is that I have no intention of letting Nemesis get away with any of this. Thanks to the documents you found a while back and Lockhart's files, I have a pretty good idea of where Nemesis might be holding his latest prisoner. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to go in there and capture Nosferatu.</A> <br><br>Hunting down one wanted criminal and fighting another at the same time feels good again. No helping one bad guy to offset another, just doing the right thing from the start."
// AcceptString :
"P3092128522" "Capture Nosferatu"
// SendOffString :
"P3441120237" "I'm betting that Nemesis is using Nosferatu to work on something related to biology, probably involving artificial life extension. Any information Nemesis might get on that could cause a lot of trouble, so you'll need to catch Nosferatu and anyone he may be directly working with."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3904066466" "Capture Nosferatu & his assistants"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P803169457" "The exterior of this office building hides several secret levels housing a Nemesis-built research lab. Somewhere in here, Nosferatu himself is being held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2796580653" "That Nosferatu is kind of creepy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3808861787" "Yes. But brilliant as well!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4026966219" "Nosferatu"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P204355014" "That is a truly radical new approach to an artificial longevity system. I'm quite fascinated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3244883636" "Ah, {HeroName}. If it is not the Center or Nemesis it is always heroes like you interrupting my work!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P631262043" "Lab mainframe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P699855468" "You found some interesting files."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2026278886" "You have captured Nosferatu, one of the leaders of the Council and a captive of Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1870180236" "That's how you do it, {HeroName}! Nosferatu is in Ziggursky under heavy guard. He's wanted for so many crimes in so many countries it'll take half a decade for them to figure out who gets to try him for what and where they'll hold court. From all of the reports from his guards, Nosferatu is acting almost like this is a vacation. I suppose when your normal job is working for the Center, prison could be kind of relaxing. <br><br>Now we just have to figure out what Nemesis wanted Nosferatu's expertise for. I'm going to hit every contact I have who might know about Nosferatu's interrogation. Anything that he lets slip could lead us a step closer to Nemesis himself. This isn't over, but it's getting close."
// RandomFameString :
"P3685728168" "I feel safer tucking my children into bed at night now that Nosferatu's in the Big Zig."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Nemesis1_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4148382358" "I've found out a bunch of interesting things from Nosferatu's interrogation. It seems that Nemesis had abducted him specifically for his knowledge of life extension techniques. According to Nosferatu, Nemesis is pretty much a 180-year-old-brain and glandular system being kept alive in his powered armor, but those remaining biological pieces are dying. Nosferatu hasn't spoken yet about the final end of the project, but we know that part of it was testing that final product against Rikti biomorphing and Crey mind control technology. I'd like you to follow up on those angles. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>First, I want you to hit the same base Nemesis harvested Rikti technology from.</A> Maybe we can work backwards to find out what he was looking to protect himself against."
// AcceptString :
"P1249986308" "Hit the same base Nemesis harvested Rikti technology from"
// SendOffString :
"P1710818866" "Your goal is to find information in there, not wipe the place out. I don't think anyone will complain if you do, but it's not a priority. <br><br>Longevity seems to be what's tying all of this together. If Nosferatu is telling the truth, we could be seeing Nemesis' last days now."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P84773486" "Find clues in Rikti base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4012933024" "Your goal is to find information in there, not wipe the place out. I don't think anyone will complain if you do, but it's not a priority."

